{{also|Appendix:Variations of "tina"}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Short form of {{l|en|Christina}} or of any female name ending in -tina, such as {{l|en|Martina}} or {{l|en|Albertina}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈtiːnə/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{given name|en|female|from=Ancient Greek}}.
# {{place|en|lake|s/Alaska}}, near/around [[Anchorage]]. <!--really same name ety?-->

===Anagrams===
* {{anagrams|en|a=aint|NAIT|Tain|Tani|Tian|ain't|aniṭ|anti|anti-|nait|tain|tian}}

